# Doris append writer integration on the released paimon-rust v0.4.0.
# Java Paimon 1.4.2 uses CommitMessageSerializer v11 and 20-field DataFileMeta.
# Export only losslessly representable append messages and bound the encoded list.
# Expose pinned Arrow schemas, message ranges and explicit awaited writer shutdown.
# Close rolled files synchronously to bound outstanding file-close work.
# This does not provide a hard limit on all native allocations or in-flight cancellation.
# Flush metered writers when retained input reaches the buffer threshold.
